---
// ContextContrast.astro - Realitas di Lapangan (Cara Lama vs Pendekatan Halaqoh)
---

<section class="section-space" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cream) 0%, #ebe2cc 100%);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head text-center max-w-[680px] mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="section-eyebrow text-[0.8rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--forest)] mb-2 block">
        Realitas di Lapangan
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.2vw,2.5rem)] mb-4">
        Mengapa Buku Catatan Kertas Sering Menjadi Beban?
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle text-[1.05rem] text-[var(--ink-secondary)]">
        Halaqoh lahir dari pengalaman nyata di musholla dan TPA, menggantikan cara lama yang rapuh dengan alur digital yang sederhana.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contrast-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Cara Lama -->
      <div class="contrast-card legacy bg-[#f5eedf] border-[1.5px] border-[#9c917b] rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] p-8 shadow-[3px_3px_0_#9c917b] relative">
        <div class="contrast-header flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-[var(--border-soft)]">
          <div class="contrast-icon w-9 h-9 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] flex items-center justify-center font-bold bg-[#ecdccb] text-[var(--clay)] border border-[#d4ba9f] shrink-0">
            ✕
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[1.25rem] font-bold">Cara Lama (Buku Fisik & Chat WA)</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--clay)]">Rentan tercecer dan memakan waktu</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="contrast-list flex flex-col gap-4 list-none">
          <li class="contrast-item flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem]">
            <svg class="mt-1 shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--clay)" stroke-width="2.5">
              <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Buku catatan mudah basah atau hilang:</strong> Santri lupa membawa buku, guru kesulitan mengingat ayat terakhir yang dipelajari.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="contrast-item flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem]">
            <svg class="mt-1 shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--clay)" stroke-width="2.5">
              <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Orang tua jarang memeriksa:</strong> Catatan di tas santri sering kali tidak dibuka sampai akhir semester.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="contrast-item flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem]">
            <svg class="mt-1 shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--clay)" stroke-width="2.5">
              <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Rekap bulanan butuh berjam-jam:</strong> Pengurus harus menyalin manual puluhan buku ke dokumen laporan saat pembagian raport.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Cara Halaqoh -->
      <div class="contrast-card modern bg-[var(--paper)] border-[1.5px] border-[var(--border-strong)] rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] p-8 shadow-[var(--shadow-md)] relative">
        <div class="contrast-header flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-[var(--border-soft)]">
          <div class="contrast-icon w-9 h-9 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] flex items-center justify-center font-bold bg-[var(--hl-olive)] text-[var(--forest)] border-[1.5px] border-[var(--border-strong)] shrink-0">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[1.25rem] font-bold">Pendekatan Halaqoh</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--forest)]">Ringan, praktis, dan selalu sinkron</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="contrast-list flex flex-col gap-4 list-none">
          <li class="contrast-item flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem]">
            <svg class="mt-1 shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Input secepat 10 detik per santri:</strong> Guru memilih nama, sistem otomatis mendeteksi sesi shalat dan riwayat bacaan sebelumnya.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="contrast-item flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem]">
            <svg class="mt-1 shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Orang tua cukup simpan 1 tautan web:</strong> Bebas ribet login atau install aplikasi berat; data diperbarui setiap kali santri selesai mengaji.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="contrast-item flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem]">
            <svg class="mt-1 shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Cetak PDF laporan instan kapan saja:</strong> Sekali klik, langsung jadi dokumen resmi siap cetak berukuran A4 Landscape.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
